    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Delightful, detached dormer bungalow with panoramic countryside views.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWarren Estates are delighted to present this impressive dormer bungalow home at \r\nSeven Gables, Ahare, Castletown\r\n\r\nSeven Gables is an exceptional contemporary residence presented in turnkey condition, offering generous and thoughtfully designed family accommodation on a substantial private site. The light-filled, open-plan living spaces are perfectly suited to modern family living, whilst also having four spacious double bedrooms, including a superb primary bedroom with ensuite and balcony.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of the property is its unique layout, which provides two distinct living areas, making it ideally suited to multi-generational living, guest accommodation, or those seeking additional privacy and versatility within the home.\r\n\r\nSet in a peaceful yet highly accessible setting, Seven Gables enjoys beautifully maintained, fully enclosed gardens with a large lawn and west-facing patio, all complemented by breathtaking panoramic countryside views. This location offers the perfect balance of rural charm and convenience, just moments from Ballymoney Village and its renowned beach. Tara Hill Church, the local primary school, and a popular café are all within easy reach, while a nearby quiet lane leads to Kilbegnet, one of the area's most picturesque sandy beaches.\r\n\r\nGorey Town, with its full range of shops, cafés, and amenities, is only a short drive away. The M11 (Dublin–Wexford) motorway is easily accessible to this modern family home, putting Dublin less than an hour away."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch\r\nTiled floor.\r\nEntrance Hall\t5.7m x 4.6m\r\nSolid wood floors.\r\nLiving room\t\t5.2m x 4.1m\r\nSolid wood floors, feature fireplace, bay window.\r\nKitchen/dining area\r\nKitchen\t\t4.1m x 3.6m\r\nRange of wall and floor units, island unit, dishwasher, integrated fridge/freezer, electric hob and oven, extractor fan, tiled splashback, \r\nrecessed lighting, tiled floor, partially tiled walls, double doors to patio area.\r\nDining area\t\t5.5m x 4.4m\r\nFeature fireplace with insert stove, solid wood floors.\r\nSunroom\t\t4.6m x 4.4m\r\nVaulted panelled ceiling, triple aspect, tiled floor, patio doors to rear.\r\nUtility\t\t\t3.6m x 1.6m\r\nHotpress, fitted wall and floor units, washing machine, door to rear.\r\nGuest w.c.\t\t1.7m x 1.1m\r\nBathroom \t\t2m x 3.6m\r\nJacuzzi bath, w.h.b. and vanity unit, w.c., bidet, fully tiled.\r\nLiving room \t\t4.1m x 5.4m\r\nSolid wood flooring, feature fireplace.\r\nKitchen/Dining room\t4.1m x 5.2m\r\nRange of wall and floor units, fridge/freezer, electric hob & oven, extractor fan, tiled splashback, tiled floor, dual aspect windows.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding\t\t\t\r\nHotpress.\r\nPrimary bedroom \t\t4.1m x 8.6m\r\nDual aspect windows, balcony, solid wood flooring.\r\nEnsuite\t\t\t2.1m x 2.8m\r\nElectric shower w.h.b. and vanity unit, w.c., fully tiled.\r\nBedroom 2\t\t\t5.6m x 5.5m\r\nBuilt in storage, solid wood flooring.\r\nEnsuite\t\t\t2.2m x 2.0m\r\nElectric shower w.h.b and vanity unit, w.c., fully tiled.\r\nBedroom 3\t\t\t4.6m x 3.0m\r\nSolid wood flooring. \r\nBedroom 4\t\t\t4.1m x 4.6m\r\nSolid wood flooring. \r\nEnsuite\t\t\t3.1m x 1.3m\r\nElectric shower w.h.b and vanity unit, w.c., fully tiled.\r\nBedroom 5 / Office\t\t3.3m x 1.9m\r\nSolid wood flooring, velux window.\r\nBathroom\t\t\t3.1m x 1.8m\r\nBath with overhead shower, w.h.b. and vanity unit, w.c., bidet, fully tiled."
